WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.240
KATIE RICHARDSON: For all
of our certifications,

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:11.630
we list out a preparation path
on our certification pages.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.690
I think that focuses
primarily on what

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:17.450
are the trainings, what are the
resources that we can give you.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.420
We give some recommendations
for hands-on labs.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:25.280
We also recommend using the
GCP free tier or any resources

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.980
that we have to get you
into the products and tools

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.820
that you'll be assessed on.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.090
I think if you, in
addition to that,

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:34.550
need some additional
professional experience, what

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:38.750
we recommend is just using the
exam guide to see what topics

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.490
are going to be
assessed and kind

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.080
of doing a self-evaluation.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.575
Make sure that you're
there with those skills.

00:00:44.575 --> 00:00:45.950
And it might mean
that you should

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:48.350
wait six months or
a year while you

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:50.840
are getting those
additional skills before you

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.310
attempt the exam.

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:55.310
But using the exam guides
and those resources kind of

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:56.600
helps you set that benchmark.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.330
It helps you know
where you're at so

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.460
that then you can
prepare better as you're

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.990
looking at certification.

